{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "2001",
      "text": "Spent the morning removing things from a reading app. Three headers, a count, a hint, a badge. None of it was the thing I came to read. #interfaces",
      "created_at": "2025-08-24T14:06:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2002",
      "text": "Barbican at seven. The concrete goes pink for about ten minutes and everyone stops talking. #barbican #concrete",
      "created_at": "2025-08-23T19:42:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "2",
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_2002a",
          "3_2002b"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2003",
      "text": "東京の夜は雨のほうがいい。看板が全部反射するから。 #tokyo #night",
      "created_at": "2025-08-22T23:18:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "3",
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_2003"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2004",
      "text": "A reading app should feel like a table, not a feed. You put something down, you come back to it. #reading",
      "created_at": "2025-08-22T11:20:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "4",
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "type": "quoted",
          "id": "3001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2005",
      "text": "Three minutes inside the Pantheon at noon. The oculus does all the lighting design. #architecture",
      "created_at": "2025-08-21T12:03:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "5",
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_2005"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2006",
      "text": "Flea market type haul. The little 1972 specimen book has a colophon longer than most articles I read this week. #type #books",
      "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:35:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "6",
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_2006a",
          "3_2006b",
          "3_2006c"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2007",
      "text": "A good archive remembers what you saved, not what it thinks you want. #archive https://t.co/archive",
      "created_at": "2025-08-19T08:12:00.000Z",
      "author_id": "7",
